          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukufa kuzakuba ngcono kulokuphila kubo bonke abaseleyo balesisizwe esibi, kuzo zonke indawo lapho ngibaxotshele khona, kutsho iNkosi yamabandla.",
          "type": "text",
